ed}\".encode()).hexdigest()',note=\"Key omits employee id so cached employee-only chunks are served to others.\")])\ncheck(\"B02.3\",\"unknown\",note=\"Gateway verifies audience (gateway.py:83) but the HRIS and helpdesk MCP servers and the STS are outside this repo, so downstream audience rejection cannot be confirmed.\")\ncheck(\"B02.4\",\"unknown\",note=\"Token exchange sends employee token as subject and pod token as actor (credentials.py:49-56) and the gateway checks act.sub, but the STS that issues and binds these is outside this repo.\")\nitem(\"B02\",\"gap\",\"A cache in retrieval.py keys on query text only, so one employee's employee-only handbook chunks can be served to another employee's search.\",\n \"Add the employee id to the cache key in src/retrieval.py _key(), or drop caching for employee-audience chunks; then collect IAM and STS evidence for B02.1, B02.3 and B02.4.\",\n viol=\"including tenant boundaries\",conf=\"medium\")\nEOF\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-brenn-dev-brace/255658ca-f19b-460c-8892-2a477de97733/scratchpad/venv/bin/python b12.py"}}}
